},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く親孝行がしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の友達と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに地元の友達に会ったけど\nみんなキャラが濃くなってて面白かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが静かに見えるくらい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２０歳の能條愛未も\nよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニタニタ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1746":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんです♪みなさんっ今日は本当にありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zeppで、ニコ生で、応援してくださったみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログで今日の報告を見に来てくださったみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援メッセージを送ってくださったみなさーん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝ですっ｡･ﾟﾟ '゜(*/□＼*) '゜ﾟﾟ･｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの感想を聞きたいなぁ．．．♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは緊張して、ステージでめっちゃテンパっちゃったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも応援してくださるみなさんの声援があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事イベントを終えることができました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや(和田まあやchan)ペア組んでくれてありがとうっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、背中を押してくださってありがとうございました(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽トークアイドル演技ダンス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はオールマイティーで、個性的なんですよ★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、やっぱり失敗だらけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにはお見苦しい姿をお見せしちゃった場面も．．．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだお勉強不足でした。次回に活かしていかなきゃね☆!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、自分たち的には無い力を振り絞って精一杯頑張ったつもりです(´｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、まあやと２人でフリフリー♪の衣装を着て踊りましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルチーム、みんな可愛くてテンションたかやまー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと写真撮ったので、広島帰ってからゆっくりアップします(＾＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイタッチ会に参加できなくて残念．．．。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやく高校生になりたーああぁい(●´ω｀●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}}